Third party components:

FluidR3 GM soundfont (choir samples in sf/) is by Frank Wen, MIT licence.
The copyright notice and licence must travel with any redistribution.

Harmonic data in *_corpus.json is extracted from public domain scores:
  Lyadov, Ten Settings from the Obikhod, Op. 61 (before 1914)
  Arkhangelsky, Singing of Church Services, vol. 1 (St Petersburg, 1892)

Star data is from the Yale Bright Star Catalog, 5th revised edition.
Planetary elements are from the JPL approximate positions of the planets.
Telemetry originates from NASA's Deep Space Network.
